fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0801176Z Note: a multi-user installation is possible. See https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/installation/installing-binary.html#multi-user-installation
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0813106Z ^[[1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer^[[0m
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0920035Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0931400Z ^[[0m
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0932207Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0933089Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0941921Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0942598Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0943905Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0944454Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0944788Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0945450Z    if you are ready to continue.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0945735Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0946214Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0946804Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0947319Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0947713Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0947921Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0948160Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0948437Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0948652Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0949278Z    can use Nix.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0949438Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0949564Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0949755Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0950054Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0950653Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0950953Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0951093Z I will:
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0951458Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0951866Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0952376Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0952851Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0953291Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0953611Z  - install Nix in /nix
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0953918Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0954349Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0954756Z    /root
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0960661Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0961484Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0973681Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0974445Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0974730Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0975680Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mReady to continue?
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0976105Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0995138Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.0995799Z ^[[34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.1006563Z ^[[0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.1007426Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.1008141Z run in a headless fashion, like this:
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.1008486Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T14:53:50.1008777Z   $ curl -L https://nixos.org/nix/install | sh
